  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_leizi",
      "name": {
        "en": "Leizi's Badge",
        "zh": "惊蛰证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "original",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Leizi has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for employing Arts to attack multiple enemies in series.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Caster Operator during field operations to exercise Chain Caster responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员惊蛰擅长使用术法串联攻击多个敌人\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为术师干员，行使链术师职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_leizi",
      "name": {
        "en": "'All the Thunderlight'",
        "zh": "“天地通明”",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_leizi",
      "description": {
        "en": "In younger years, was Lei Fa assiduously studied, scriptures and records committed to heart. \nThen when called, bolts did not heed; when beckoned, bolts did not come. \n\nIn teenage years, progress was devoted day and night, and began awareness words lay outside of lines, within speech laid invisible speech. \nA hand waved for arcs to spark, crackling to the ears. \n\nAt twenty and two, once daily, were chanted mnemonic and creed to satisfaction. \nLightning could be drawn, thunder could be righted. \n\nApproaching thirty, the Way was nature, essences mighty yet held concealed. \nDispelled was malice and rid was evil, unpardoned were the guilty. \nSpake the teacher: 'Satisfactory.' \nThereupon was granted a fine pair of crystals, with limpid lightning filled, in pallid thunder coated, as though the sense it would shatter and roar. \nSpake the teacher: 'As Minister of the Central Judicial Office, this ceremony is held. Now I grant thee these crystals, and thou shalt name them.' \nYoung and ambitious were thoughts, diligent in studied creed, only wishing to command the five thunders, to cower the wicked. \nYet sensed was the realm's boundlessness, the night endless still, levin rolling, a need to notice all the world's difficulties. \nThus she replied: 'All the Thunderlight.'",
        "zh": "黄口之年，苦学雷法，经文典籍烂熟于心。\n然唤霆霆不应，招雷雷不至。\n\n豆蔻年华，日夜精进，始知文外有文，话中有话。\n挥手电花烁烁，耳中噼啪声响。\n\n待到二十有二，每日一省，口诀律令随心而至。\n可引天雷，可正霆威。\n\n及近而立，道法自然，内蕴千钧而不外露。\n祛邪除恶，有罪无赦。\n师曰：“尚可。”\n乃赠精晶一对，内盈澄雷，外覆苍霆，似有迸碎轰鸣之感。\n师曰：“既为大理寺卿，当持杖节。现授汝晶石，汝自名之。”\n想及年少有志，勤习律令，惟愿号令五雷，以慑邪佞。\n又感天地苍茫，长夜漫漫，雷声轰隆，得察世间万难。\n故答：“天地通明。”",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
